        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Good afternoon, Avicenna Sales Department,</div><div> </div><div>I hope you're doing well! My name is Dariya Ovsyannikova and I am a lab manager for Dr. Michael Inzlicht's Social Neuroscience (Work and Play) Lab, which has an Avicenna account. I was wondering if you could kindly provide me with the contact information of the individual(s) in charge of responding to Avicenna licensing questions? One of our graduate students in the lab requested this information. Thank you in advance for any and all of your help, and I look forward to speaking with you soon.</div><div> </div><div>Warm regards,</div><div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\" color: rgb(23, 78, 134);\">\n<b>Dariya Ovsyannikova, HBSc</b>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> Laboratory Manager, <span style=\" background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Work and Play Lab</span>\n</div>\n<div>Toronto Laboratory for Social Neuroscience (SY162)</div>\n<div>University of Toronto Scarborough</div>\n<div>1265 Military Trail, Toronto ON M1C 1A4</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img style=\"max-width:100%;width: 146px;max-height: 65px;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25492/78010/131720?view=inline\"></span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>",
