        "body": "<div>\n<div>Hi Dasha,</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>I hope you are doing well.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Thank you for reaching out to us. My name is Sara and I would be happy to help you with this matter.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Study ID: 4090 has been added to your lab license and it's all set on our end. It would be very helpful if you could provide a brief description or abstract of the study, if possible. We aim to share this information with the community to help other researchers with their work.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Please feel free to reach out if you need anything else.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Sara</div>\n<br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, October 24, 2024 at 10:43:24 PM, D Sandra wrote:<br><br>Hi Amin,<div> </div>\n<div>Apologies for the delay in getting back. It would be great to add our new study 4090 code to the lab license.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Thanks,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Dasha<br><div>\n<br><span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><blockquote type=\"cite\">\n<div>On Oct 3, 2024, at 2:42 PM, Amin Tavassolian &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt; wrote:</div>\n<br><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px !important; margin: revert !important; color: revert !important; font-size: revert !important; text-align: revert !important; background: revert !important; padding: revert !important; vertical-align: revert !important; width: 500px; border-spacing: 0px !important;\"><tbody><tr style=\" background: revert !important; border: revert !important; color: revert !important; font-size: revert !important; margin: revert !important; padding: revert !important; text-align: revert !important; vertical-align: revert !important; width: revert !important;\">\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 7px 2px !important; border-collapse: collapse; border: revert !important; color: revert !important; fon